    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01776-01777",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Levia",
      "jp": "……",
      "en": "..."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01779-01780",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "続きは？",
      "en": "The rest?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01786-01787",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "それで？",
      "en": "So?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01789-01792",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "続きを促す俺の声に怒りの為、とは少し違う様子で\nレヴィアの顔が赤くなる\nなにか、様子が変だな……",
      "en": "When I urged her to continue, Levia's face reddened, but not quite in anger. Something felt strange..."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01798-01800",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Refin",
      "jp": "レヴィア将軍、後の報告は私の方から致しますので\n将軍は兵達の様子を見てきて頂けますか？",
      "en": "General Levia, I will handle the rest of the report. Could you please go check on the soldiers?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01806-01808",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "レヴィアの様子を見かねたレフィンが、助け船を出すように、\n声を掛けるが、レヴィアは其の言葉に逡巡するような間を\n置いた後、俺の目を真正面から見据えた。",
      "en": "Refin, unable to watch Levia any longer, threw her a lifeline. But after a pause, Levia stared straight into my eyes."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01810-01812",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Levia",
      "jp": "いい、私から報告する\nこの街で目撃されているラティナ王女のことだが……",
      "en": "No, I will give the report.\nAbout the Princess Latina sighting in this town..."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01814-01815",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "何か、あるのか？",
      "en": "What is it?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01817-01820",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Levia",
      "jp": "黙って聴け……そのラティナ王女の事だが……\n夜な夜な街に現れては街の男を襲い、\nその……精気を吸い取っているらしい……",
      "en": "Shut up and listen... About Princess Latina...\nNight after night, she appears, attacks men,\nand, well... drains their essence..."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01822-01823",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "精気？　睡魔の様にか",
      "en": "Essence? Like a succubus?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01825-01826",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Levia",
      "jp": "そうだ……",
      "en": "That's right..."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01828-01830",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "睡魔とは男の前には女、女の前には男の姿で現れ、\n男女の夜の営みを交いして相手から生命力ともいえる\n精気を吸い取って生きる悪魔の総称だ",
      "en": "A succubus is a type of demon that appears as a woman to men and as a man to women, engaging in nightly intimacies to drain their partner's essence, which is akin to life force."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01832-01834",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Levia",
      "jp": "報告は以上だ、精々貴様も襲われぬように\n気を付けるのだな",
      "en": "That's the report. Just be careful\nyou don't get attacked yourself."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01839-01841",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "残りの言葉を急いで言い放ったレヴィアは、\n赤くした顔を隠すようにそそくさと部屋から\n出ていってしまった。",
      "en": "Levia rattled off the rest of her report,\nthen scurried out of the room, trying to hide\nher flushed face."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01843-01844",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "こういう話しに関しては相変わらず初だな……",
      "en": "She's still so naive about that kind of talk..."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01850-01851",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Refin",
      "jp": "そうですね",
      "en": "Indeed."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01853-01871",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "レヴィアに置いて行かれたレフィンが細い目を一層細めて\n相槌を打つ\n俺はふと、昔のレヴィアの事を思い出していた……\n十数年前、俺がレウィニアの王都に屋敷を与えられ\n『水の巫女』に事あれば力を貸す同盟者として\n束の間の平穏を得たばかりの頃、レヴィアとレフィンが\n俺の前に現れたのはそんな時だ。\n二人とも、騎士の家系に生まれ、レフィンは俺の強さに憧れ、\nレヴィアは白いドレスに身を包み儚い笑顔と白い花を手に、\nただ逃亡生活に疲れた俺の心を癒すかの様に何時も俺の側で\n微笑んでいた……。\nそれから幾年かの月日が巡り、水の巫女との盟約により幾つ\nもの戦乱に赴き、死地を潜り抜けて帰って来た俺を出迎えた\nのは、ドレスの換わりに甲冑を身に纏い、花の換わりに剣を、\n笑顔の代わりに決意の光をその目に宿した今のレヴィアだった。",
      "en": "Left behind by Levia, Refin narrows her already slender eyes in agreement. I suddenly remember the Levia of the past... Over ten years ago, when I was granted a mansion in the royal capital of Lewinia and had just gained a fleeting peace as an ally to the Water Maiden, that was when Levia and Refin appeared before me. Both born to knightly families, Refin admired my strength, while Levia, clad in a white dress with a fleeting smile and white flowers in hand, always stayed by my side, smiling as if to soothe my heart weary from a life on the run. Years passed, and after many battles under my pact with the Water Maiden, when I returned from countless brushes with death, it was Levia who greeted me: no longer in a dress but in armor, sword in place of flowers, and in her eyes a light of resolve instead of her former smile."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01873-01874",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Refin",
      "jp": "セリカさん？",
      "en": "Celica?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01882-01882",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "俺は頭を一振りして、意識をはっきりさせた",
      "en": "I shook my head to clear my mind."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01889-01893",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "レフィンが腰を屈めて俺を見下ろしている\n余りにも背が高すぎるレフィンは一般的な建物の中では\n頭が天井に付いてしまう為、やや身を屈めたこの姿勢が\n癖になってしまっているそうだ",
      "en": "Refin stoops to look down at me. She is so tall that in ordinary buildings her head hits the ceiling, so this slightly hunched posture has become a habit, I hear."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01898-01900",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "この部屋はこの領主の館の客間らしい、応接間ではなく\nこの部屋に俺を通したのは、高価な物の置いてある応接間は\n使わないようにしている為だろう",
      "en": "This room is probably a guest room in the lords mansion, not the reception room. They sent me here to avoid using the room where the valuables are kept."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:01905-01906",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Refin",
      "jp": "どうしましたセリカさん？",
      "en": "Is something wrong, Celica?"
    }
  ]
}

